Valve corrected the reference to third_party_licenses.txt in May 2019.
The corrected license requires SDK redistributions to include the LICENSE file.
https://github.com/ValveSoftware/halflife/commit/c76dd531a79a176eef7cdbca5a80811123afbbe2

The browser runtime includes the same file at licenses/valve-hl1-sdk/LICENSE
inside extras.pk3. The server image includes it at
/usr/share/licenses/valve-hl1-sdk/LICENSE.

